<title>UK: ABN Amro sets warrants on Carrefour.</title>
<headline>ABN Amro sets warrants on Carrefour.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>ABN Amro Bank N.V. has issued 350,000 American-style call warrants, on Carrefour shares, lead manager ABN Amro Finance S.A.said.</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    3600 FRF		  PREMIUM	=</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     37.20 FRF		 GEARING	8.84 X</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 03.MAR.97-30.DEC.98   PAYDATE	28.FEB.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   PARIS		     MIN EXER LOT 1000</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
